<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela banks and markets closed Thursday,Friday.</title>
<headline>Venezuela banks and markets closed Thursday,Friday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan banks and financial markets are closed Thursday and Friday for Easter holidays.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
